                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A simple JRPG made with a unity engine. In my opinion, it is not that bad of a game. Here are my pros and cons:\n\nPROS:\n\n`Cute graphics\n`Female protagonist\n`Nice Music\n`Bosses!\n`Secrets!\n\nCONS:\n\n`Developers did not make exit game in menu. You have to use ALT+F4 to exit the game.\n`Same music in every town\n`Storyline is hardly in the game, but there is one\n`To be continued??? really?\n`No beginning help very much. I made my own guide to deal with this somewhat.\n`The game seems to be a bit short.  I really wish it was a little bit longer.\n\nRecommeded for fun if you like JRPGs. Don't expect a triple A game though. There is hardly any storyline, but some npc's are quite funny at what they say. In the end, i recommend it!\n\nBe sure to use my Guide to help you in the game!\n\nhttp://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=928422668",
